{
  "slug": "superdevflow",
  "name": "Superdevflow",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Claude Code plugin for GitHub Actions debugging, conversation cloning/half-cloning, context handoffs, and CLAUDE.md review",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `clone` (Clone the current conversation so the user can branch off and try a different approach), `gha` (Analyze GitHub Actions failures and identify root causes), `half-clone` (Clone the later half of the current conversation, discarding earlier context to reduce token usage while preserving recent…), `handoff` (Write or update a handoff document so the next agent with fresh context can continue this work), `review-claudemd` (Review recent conversations to find improvements for CLAUDE.md files)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install superdevflow@claude-community` from `ykdojo/superdevflow`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
